    "interval_union": "Reference and predicted intervals are unioned per claim before sample counts and intersections are calculated; overlapping or touching intervals cannot double-count.",
    "localization": "Only intervals attached to an exactly matched claim ID can contribute to evidence overlap.",
    "denominators": "Each rate stores an exact integer numerator and denominator; zero denominators have null rate.",
    "limitations": "These synthetic vectors test arithmetic and structural policy only; they do not validate audio truth or model-internal evidence use."
